Issue 1: No input validation
Problem
Accessing data['name'], data['sku'], etc. directly
Missing or malformed JSON will cause runtime errors
Impact
API crashes with 500 errors
Bad client experience
Production instability
Fix
Validate required fields
Return proper 400 errors

 Issue 2: SKU uniqueness not enforced
Problem
No check if SKU already exists
Business rule says SKU must be unique across platform
Impact
Duplicate SKUs → broken reporting, ordering, integrations
Fix
Enforce DB unique constraint
Check before insert

 Issue 3: Price type handling
Problem
price=data['price'] without validation
Could be string, float, invalid
Impact
Floating-point precision issues
Incorrect financial calculations
Fix
Use Decimal
Validate numeric input

 Issue 4: Products tied directly to warehouse
Problem
warehouse_id stored in Product
But products can exist in multiple warehouses
Impact
Incorrect data model
Cannot scale to multiple warehouses
Fix
Remove warehouse_id from Product
Use Inventory as junction table

 Issue 5: No transaction safety
Problem
Two commits
If inventory insert fails, product is still created
Impact
Orphaned products
Data inconsistency
Fix
Wrap in a single DB transaction

 Issue 6: Initial quantity not validated
Problem
Negative or missing initial_quantity allowed
Impact
Negative stock in system
Broken alerts and analytics
Fix
Validate quantity >= 0


